# Workout App Architecture Walkthrough

This walkthrough explains how your fitness app works from the ground up. Even without deep TypeScript/React Native experience, you'll understand the patterns and data flow.

![alt text](image.png)
Reading this diagram: Data flows from bottom to top. Models define the shape of data. Services read/write that data to the database. The Store holds the "current" state for the active workout. UI layers display and modify state.
